== Description ==

'''Shiv''' is a melee weapon in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Anvil]]. It appears as an ingredient in 1 downstream recipes at the [[Anvil]], including [[Blade Baseball Bat]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

